  {
   "heading": "Ordering politely",
   "body": "ラーメンを おねがいします = ramen, please. おねがいします is slightly more formal/polite than ください and great in restaurants."
  },
  {
   "heading": "Getting started",
   "body": "メニューを ください = menu please. すみません calls the staff over. おすすめは なんですか = what do you recommend?"
  },
  {
   "heading": "Paying",
   "body": "おかいけい おねがいします = the bill, please. べつべつで = separately (split the bill)."
  }
 ],
